OL,3,GNEWSARare Bronze Age finds unearthed in
OL,4,Acity dig
OL,5,
OL,6,FInsects and a child burial from the
OL,7,FBronze Age are among "very rare" finds
OL,8,Funearthed at an archaeological dig on
OL,9,Fthe edge of a city.
OL,11,FArchaeologists also found pieces of
OL,12,Fworked timber in the waterhole near
OL,13,FQuedgeley, Gloucester, which show axe
OL,14,Fmarks and evidence of wood-splitting.
OL,16,FCotswold Archaeology said a large
OL,17,Fnumber of insects such as water fleas
OL,18,Fwere found which illustrated a number
OL,19,Fof different ancient habitats.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
